  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e20ce9f6737e6e845b50655fcc50fb57, type: 3}
  m_Name: VoldemortEntrace
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  speakerName: Coldemort
  lines:
  - So this is where you've been hiding it, Humbledore.
  - 'DUMBLEDORE: You are not invited here, Coldemort.'
  - For far too long, you have allowed your students to share what should have belonged
    to its creators.
  - Code. Knowledge. Magic.
  - All of it will belong to me now.
  - 'DUMBLEDORE: You cannot simply take the work of an entire world and lock it away!'
  - Watch me.
  - CLOSED SOURCEIMUS CONVERTIMUS!
  - 'DUMBLEDORE: NOOOOOOOOOOOO!!'
  - '[BLACK FLASH] '
  - 'DUMBLEDORE: Young wizard, we must act at once. Meet me inside the college. '
  - '*fades to black*'
